    "detailed_description": "When criminals are running free and when the justice system fails, a lone vigilante called Rider dons the mask.  A new crime boss has entered the criminal underground and it is up to you to help Rider bring a stop to him and his plans.  Kill and bring every criminal that stands in your way to justice!<br><br><u><strong>Variety of Locations</strong></u><br><br>Raid criminal hideouts, warehouses, mansions, and many more locations all in the pursuit of justice.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247930/extras/f0a1600b65a743d671ce80111bf6adcb.avif?t=1677517776\" /></span><br><br><u><strong>Tools of the Trade</strong></u><br><br>Dispense justice with a submachine gun, a sawed-off shotgun, a silenced pistol, and a baseball bat.  Sometimes simple is the best option.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247930/extras/da87c677c21fdd8693727b99942c32bd.avif?t=1677517776\" /></span><br><br><u><strong>Death comes Quickly</strong></u><br><br>There are no bullet-sponges here.  Your body armor will protect you from a couple of bullets, but you will die when you get hit a third time.",
